{"ref":"BDB, לְבֹנָה","hw":"לְבֹנָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לְבֹנָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבוֹנָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. frankincense (</strong>from <em>white</em> colour, cf. Lag<sup>BN 33</sup>; NH <em>id.</em>; Aramaic <em>id.</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבוּנְתָּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܠܒܽܘܢܬܳܐ</span>; Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">לבנת</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">لُبَانٌ</span> (Lane <sup>3007</sup>); Ethiopic ሊባኖስ is from λιβανος<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ל׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:24\" href=\"/Exodus.30.24\">Ex 30:24</a> + 18 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבֹנָתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.2\">Lv 2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.16\">16</a>;—used in prep. of holy incense <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:34\" href=\"/Exodus.30.34\">Ex 30:34</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סַמִּים</span>); used as incense <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.20\">Je 6:20</a>, on meal-offering <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.1\">Lv 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:8\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.8\">6:8</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:11\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.11\">5:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 5:15\" href=\"/Numbers.5.15\">Nu 5:15</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.26\">Je 17:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 41:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.41.5\">41:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.23\">Is 43:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.3\">66:3</a>; with shew-bread <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 24:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.24.7\">Lv 24:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.5\">Ne 13:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:9\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.29\">1 Ch 9:29</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשָׂמִים</span>); burned as perfume (art. of luxury) <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.6\">Ct 3:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹר</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבְעַת חַלְּבוֹנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.6\">4:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַר הַמּוֹר</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲצֵי לְבוֹנָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:14\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.14\">14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נֵרְדְּ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְכֹּם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָנֶה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנָּמוֹן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲהָלוֹת</span>); as tribute to Zion <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.6\">Is 60:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זהב</span>).—In Hex only P.","next":"BDB, לְבוֹנָה","prev":"BDB, לִבְנָה"}